#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Temporal Summary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Temporal Summary（时间摘要）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Objective, indiscriminate digests of conversation activity over time buckets.\n"
"> Related: [`memory.md`](memory.md), [`sleep.md`](sleep.md), [`diary.md`](../features/diary.md), [`compression.md`](compression.md), [`entity-model.md`](entity-model.md).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:10 docs/sap/tools.md:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**时间摘要** (`temporal_summary`) — digests **of conversation content**, bucketed by **day / month / year**. Not a memory taxonomy entry (semantic / limbic / narrative), not diary prose, not the runtime compression `summary` segment.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs Diary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Axis           | Diary                  | Temporal summary                                                       |\n"
"| -------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Stance         | Subjective             | Objective                                                              |\n"
"| Selection      | Editorial              | Indiscriminate coverage of active sessions                             |\n"
"| Storage        | `diary_entry` + blocks | Global → entity; today per-conversation → `conversations.temporal_day` |\n"
"| Primary reader | `/diary` UI            | System prompt (yesterday+) / timeline inject (today peers)             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:24
msgid ""
"LLM compression still applies (char caps). **Objective ≠ exhaustive log "
"replay**: cover events without an editorial “worth remembering” filter, but "
"write **event-level** digests (themes + outcomes). Omit internal IDs, step-"
"by-step tool/config actions, and per-notification timestamps unless "
"essential to understand what happened."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Storage layers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer                           | Where                                           | Citable (`[[anima:id]]`) |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n"
"| Global day / month / year       | `entities` `primary_component=temporal_summary` | Yes                      |\n"
"| Conversation day chunks (today) | `conversations.temporal_day` JSONB              | **No** (operational)     |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conversation JSONB"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (ts)
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  cst_date: string,\n"
"  chunks: Array<{\n"
"    at: string,\n"
"    bucket: string, // CST half-hour bucket start, e.g. 2026-07-18T06:00+08:00\n"
"    summary: string,\n"
"    watermark_message_id?: string,\n"
"    watermark_at?: string,\n"
"  }>\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:48
msgid ""
"Chunks are **append-only** within a CST day. Tick only pushes new chunks "
"when there are messages after the watermark."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Global entity body"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (ts)
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "{ window: \"day\" | \"month\" | \"year\", period_start: string } // CST YYYY-MM-DD\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:56
msgid ""
"Unique on `(window, period_start)` for global rows (expression unique index)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Step               | Trigger                                                  | Output                                                     |\n"
"| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Conversation chunk | `builtin-temporal-summary-tick` `*/30`                   | Append chunk if new messages                               |\n"
"| Peer rollup        | Same tick / on assemble for **closed** buckets           | One merged peer digest per viewer source-set → Redis cache |\n"
"| Global day         | Sleep step `temporal-summary-day` (after light-sleep)    | Overwrite global `day` entity for sleep day                |\n"
"| Month / year       | Sleep step `temporal-summary-cascade` (after deep-sleep) | Month on month-end; year on Dec 31                         |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:67
msgid ""
"Identity context (self + resident) must ride with LLM summarization calls."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Redis peer rollup key"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (text)
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "{prefix}:peer_roll:{cst_date}:{bucket}:{sources_fp}\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:79
msgid ""
"Default prefix: `anima:temporal` (config "
"`memory.temporal_summary.redis_key_prefix`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:79
msgid ""
"`sources_fp`: short hash of canonical sorted `(conversation_id, at, "
"summary)` **excluding the viewer**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:79
msgid "Value: `{ summary, sources_fp, created_at }`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:79
msgid ""
"TTL: ~36h (discardable cache via Redis cache layer + in-process fallback)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:79
msgid ""
"Miss: LLM merge (or concatenate truncate if LLM unavailable); Hit: reuse"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:81
msgid ""
"Same source set shares one key across viewers that exclude the same peers."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "Injection（LLM prefix / KV cache）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Content                       | Where                                    | When it changes               |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| Yesterday … earlier (rolling) | System prompt section `temporal-summary` | CST 02:00 rebuild only        |\n"
"| Today other sessions          | **Not** system                           | Closed half-hour buckets only |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Today: timeline insert (one block per closed bucket)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:92
msgid "When assembling messages for viewer `V`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:97
msgid ""
"For each **closed** CST half-hour bucket today, collect other sessions’ "
"chunks in that bucket."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:97
msgid "Resolve peer rollup via Redis key above → **one** summary string."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:97
msgid ""
"Insert a runtime-only assistant message (`name: temporal_summary_peers`) at "
"`bucket_end` on `V`’s timeline (by message timestamps)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:97
msgid ""
"Never rewrite older buckets; new activity only opens newer buckets → stable "
"prefix for LLM KV cache across parallel sessions."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/cognition/temporal-summary.md:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Forbidden:** putting today peers in system prompt; per-turn tail replace of a stable today block; injecting N raw peer chunks side-by-side for one bucket.\n"
msgstr ""

